{"id":"gracia","lemma":"gracia","pos":"noun","rank":1304,"glosses":["grace, charm","mercy","humor, comic quality"],"ipa":"/ˈɡɾaθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"gracias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-gracia.wav","formAudio":{"gracias":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-gracias.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La primera vez no me hizo ninguna gracia.","en":"At first I didn't like it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/451074","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"nobody","l":"ninguno"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"first time"]]},{"text":"No me hizo ni pizca de gracia.","en":"It wasn't funny at all.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/769716","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"Forms an emphatic…"},{"g":"a little bit"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Me hace gracia que lo preguntes.","en":"It's funny you should ask.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611331","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to ask","l":"preguntar"}]},{"text":"Tom comenzó a hacerle gracia a Mary.","en":"Tom began to tickle Mary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804263","words":[null,{"g":"to begin, to commence","l":"comenzar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null,{"g":"to"},null]},{"text":"¿Por qué me das a mí las gracias?","en":"Why thank me?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/425354","words":[null,null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"the / them"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"why, for what reason"]]}]}